  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken Parisienne",
  "description": "Chicken breasts slow cooked with a creamy white wine and mushroom mixture. This quick-and-easy recipe calls for just five main ingredients, yet is tasty enough to serve for company! My husband normally doesn't like chicken, yet asks for seconds whenever I prepare this. I spoon the sauce over the chicken and serve with rice or noodles.",
